#   Juneteenth National Independence Day Act was signed 17 June 2021 (see the
#   cited page), so its rule carries a "2021-" validity range.
# retrieved: 2026-07-21
# categories: public|regional|municipal|religious|school
# columns: kind | name | args | categories | subdiv | observed
