#
# ==========================================================================
# HALF-DAY HOLIDAYS -- span-native DateSpan demonstration (span = half_pm)
# ==========================================================================
# A half-day holiday is not a whole day with a flag: it is a genuinely narrower
# DateSpan. "half_pm" resolves to the free afternoon [12:00, 24:00) of the day
# (12 hours wide) -- offices close at noon. is_civil_holiday() is therefore
# honest: the morning of a half-day is a working period.
#
# 1) Puerto Rico Christmas Eve (from 12pm): a recurring statutory half-day,
#    Law No. 305 of 25 Dec 2002 (adds Christmas Eve to 1 LPRA sec.71 as a
#    from-noon holiday), in force from 2003. Name follows the reference gloss.
# 2) U.S. federal Christmas Eve half-day closing: granted by Executive Order in
#    2002 (EO 13281), 2009 (EO 13523) and 2015 (EO 13713) -- the President
#    closing executive departments at noon on 24 December. Primary: the Federal
#    Register EO documents cited in vacanza's united_states.py header.
fixed  | Christmas Eve (from 12pm)          | 12 24                                | public | US-PR |  | 2003- | half_pm
decree | Christmas Eve (half-day closing)   | 2002-12-24 2009-12-24 2015-12-24     | public |       |  |       | half_pm
